WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:51.900
During their journey, Lief and his companions met a friendly old couple, Nij and Doj.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:58.500
But, they were actually two of Sorceress Thaegan's children, Jin and Jod.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:07.800
While they were in trouble, they were rescued by Manus, a Ralad man, and Kree who they had sent away.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:13.800
They managed to defeat the monsters and are now headed to their next destination, the Lake of Tears.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.200
He's still following us.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.500
If our numbers increase, it will only raise the chances of Thaegan finding us...

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.300
Manus!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.900
You're fine now; let's part ways here.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:04:01.000
"You three saved my precious life twice."

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.600
It seems like he wants to return the favour.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.600
That again?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.850
We were saved by you as well.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.750
So it's fine, really.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:17.100
You're finally free from Jin and Jod.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.100
You can go anywhere you'd like.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:29.950
I see!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:36.400
In order to get to the Lake of Tears, we have to pass through his hometown, Raladin!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.200
The city of the Ralads?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:42.250
That means Manus knows where the Lake of Tears is!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.600
I see. That's definitely helpful.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.750
Let's have him show us the way!

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:58.350
<i>With this, they decided to continue their journey with Manus leading the way.</i>

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.900
<i>Manus explained that it takes three days of travel to get to Raladin.</i>

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:07.500
<i>But it is by no means an easy journey.</i>

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:15.000
<i>To avoid Thaegan's gaze, they travelled along bush- concealed roads.</i>

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:22.250
<i>They had to lie on the hard ground where they shivered in the cold and struggled to sleep,</i>

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.200
<i>This being most hard on the wounded Jasmine.</i>

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:30.650
<i>Even during the day, they walked through bushes and steep paths.</i>

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:36.350
<i>But as they travelled, they were put at ease by the trees they passed.</i>

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:43.900
<i>This was thanks to Jasmine's communication with each and every tree, learning whether or not Thaegan was nearby.</i>

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.650
<i>However, over time there were fewer and fewer trees and plant life to be seen.</i>

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:55.900
Manus, Manus!

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.900
Manus, let's rest here for now.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.350
No, not here.

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:04.450
It's like asking Thaegan to come and get us.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.200
Manus...

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.800
Where are you going?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.150
He's trying to tell us something.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.500
There's a shack!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:26.000
Is anyone there?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.400
Seems to be vacant.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.000
Hold on!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.400
As I thought, the Grey Guards have attacked this place.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.500
Yeah, there's no doubt.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.400
The Shadow Lord's brand.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:09.500
This isn't good. If the Grey Guards are all the way out here, the city of Raladin might be...

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.900
Let's hurry to Raladin, then!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:15.700
Jasmine... You need to rest.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:16.570
I'm fine!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.500
What is it, Manus?

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:35.400
Could he be telling us to bathe in that?

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:39.350
We don't have time to relax, here.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.350
A well, and a bucket...

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.800
Alright, let's do it!

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.250
It's not alright! A bath? Really?

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:58.100
It looks to me like Manus is looking out for you, Jasmine.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:08:00.600
I think he wants you to clean the wound.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.450
But...

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:04.500
In this case, I agree with him.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.000
You too, Lief?

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.000
You should listen to us every once in a while.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.100
And if I did, who knows where we would have ended up by now...

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.850
It's that symbol again.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.500
A bird? Is that what it means?

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.100
Why is it there?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.700
I've heard of this before.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:33.500
There is a group called the Resistance who stand up against the Shadow Lord's army.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:38.650
So their symbol was a bird, to represent freedom.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:45.100
If the symbol was drawn here, then it means the Resistance were also here.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.700
I'm fine. I think I'm re- energised.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:09.500
Delicious! This is unbelievable; to think Barda could make something so tasty!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.600
You were right to suggest that we rest here. I feel better!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:16.500
But...

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.400
Yeah, I'm concerned about Raladin as well.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.400
Why did the Shadow Lord take over Raladin?

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:30.930
He wanted to enslave the Ralads, given that they were skilled, hardworking architects.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:40.630
Discovering this plan, Manus set out for the city of Del to ask the Resistance for help.

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:42.300
I see...

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:46.350
The Resistance of Del was defeated long ago...

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.350
But the Resistance still exists!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:53.900
There are still people like us who have the same goal!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.400
You're right. I'm sure Raladin is being protected by the Resistance!

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.700
Alright, let's get moving!

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:12.600
Manus, can you slow down a bit?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.700
We're close.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:17.100
We're probably close to Raladin.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.400
Looks like we can get through.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.880
Alright, let's go to Raladin!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.500
I didn't expect a path to be here. I'm glad we have Manus with us.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:58.700
Raladin is close!

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:13.700
This is... Raladin.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.500
No one's... here...

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.550
Just what has happened in this city?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.700
Manus...

00:11:54.700 --> 00:12:00.900
Manus thinks all of the Ralads were kidnapped by the Grey Guards.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.600
Maybe they escaped?

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:06.300
The Ralads don't ever leave their land.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:10.100
Because no matter what, this is their home.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:15.100
The Shadow Lord's brand was left all over the city.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.100
So they came here too...

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:29.200
How can we cheer him up at a time like this...?

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.050
Well...

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:10.400
Manus...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.100
Shit...

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.100
This is...

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.330
What's going on?

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.960
The Ralads are amazing!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:35.600
They dug and created a hidden underground city!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:39.700
It must have been a huge operation!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:44.850
I told you, didn't I? They're skilled, hard-working architects.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:47.300
And they never abandon their homeland.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.900
Although, even I didn't think they would go this far.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:56.100
Being relieved won't fill your stomach.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.700
Come and eat, Lief!

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:58.600
Good idea.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:02.600
Tomorrow, we're finally off to the Lake of Tears.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:06.000
No, let's stay here for a few days.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.200
Just like you said to him, I bet Manus would tell you to heal first as well.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:15.000
Geez, fine.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.150
And, we will...

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:22.700
How's that?!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:27.500
Don't always try to fight with strength alone.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:29.070
You have speed!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:34.000
How stupid, doing something that will just exhaust them...

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:41.300
<i>Lief and the others decided to enjoy a moment of respite in Raladin's underground city.</i>

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:48.600
<i>This may even be the first time Jasmine has slept in a soft bed.</i>

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:56.700
<i>But, sooner or later, they had to leave and go off on their journey.</i>

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.500
Thank you.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.200
You were so kind for having us.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:03.600
And for the food and clothes.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.900
We're going to bring Manus with us for a little while longer, but we promise that no harm will come to him.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.400
"Where are you going?"

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.900
You didn't tell them?

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:24.700
That we're going to the Lake of Tears?

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.300
You're telling us not to go?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.500
"The Evil City."

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.100
This is...

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.700
"Soldeen."

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.900
It's something they fear.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:53.500
Soldeen?

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:59.800
Whatever it is, it seems like we should reconsider going near it.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.900
Just like the Sorceress Thaegan.

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:10.100
"You can't... defeat Sorceress Thaegan."

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.800
What do you mean?

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:24.100
"To defeat that sorceress... you must make her bleed."

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:27.300
"All you need is one drop."

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:35.900
"But, Thaegan... protects her body with magic."

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:47.500
"Many people have confronted her... but none who have done so... have returned."

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:51.300
But we have no choice but to go!

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:55.400
"Tell us why."

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.600
We can't...

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.600
But please trust us.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:04.850
We're going to save Deltora and its people.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.000
Sorry for making you come along, Manus.

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:35.350
Yeah, let's go!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:58.400
Manus, you're saying the Lake of Tears is over there?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.900
Thank you. You've been a great help.

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:06.800
We'll be fine from here, so return to the others; back to Raladin.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:15.100
It's fine now. They're worried sick about you.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.900
Okay, let's go together!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.300
This place is...

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.400
The Lake of Tears.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:42.200
D'Or was once a beautiful city that everyone adored.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.500
To think that it became this due to Thaegan's magic...

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.100
Is there any change with the belt?

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:58.250
Nope, nothing yet.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:07.360
There is a special gem hidden in this lake.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:12.000
It's necessary for saving Deltora.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:15.100
I'm telling you this because I trust you, so...

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.700
Be careful.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.900
It might be dangerous here too.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.200
There's only one way to find out.

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:35.000
We can go on.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:48.200
It's here! The gem is here, somewhere in this lake.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.400
There's danger!

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:06.800
We did it!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.000
Not yet.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.000
The belt is hot.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:23.500
That's...

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:24.700
Soldeen.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.000
Are you okay, Lief?!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.600
Only just!

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:56.400
We shouldn't stick together.

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.900
Make your own decision on whether to attack or not!

00:21:58.900 --> 00:21:59.900
Got it!

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:02.400
Barda, it's coming!

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.200
Barda!

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:07.800
Soldeen.

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:11.900
Guardian of the gem in the Lake of Tears.

00:24:11.900 --> 00:24:19.710
Its mouth is full of teeth as sharp as needles, is a fast swimmer and can breath on land and underwater.

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:24.900
Once we got the gem, Thaegan appeared.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:28.000
We were defeated by her magic.

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.800
All we need to do is make her bleed one drop of blood to defeat her...!

00:24:30.800 --> 00:24:31.900
Sorceress Thaegan Appears

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:34.680
Next time, 'Sorceress Thaegan Appears'.
